### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Admin",
  "email": "testadmin2@societypro.com",
  "password": "test1234",
  "role": "SuperAdmin"
}

### Login existing user
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testadmin2@societypro.com",
  "password": "test1234"
}

